<header><p class="enc-kicker"><a href="/encyclopedia/conflicts/7th-century">Conflicts &amp; Resolutions</a> · Battle</p><h1 class="enc-title">Battle of al-Qadisiyyah</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">636 or 637 CE</span> · <a href="/centuries/7th-century">7th century</a> · Part of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/muslim-conquest-of-persia">Muslim conquest of Persia</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The Battle of al-Qadisiyyah was fought in 636 or 637 CE in southern <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/iraq">Iraq</a> between the armies of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/rashidun-caliphate">Rashidun Caliphate</a> and the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/sasanian-empire">Sasanian Empire</a>. The Arab forces won a decisive victory over the Sasanian army. The battle opened Iraq and the Sasanian capital <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/ctesiphon">Ctesiphon</a> to the Muslims and was a turning point in the fall of the Sasanian Empire.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/battle-of-al-qadisiyyah.jpg" alt="Battle of al-Qadisiyyah" width="275" height="420" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: Unknown artistUnknown artist · Public domain · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Depiction_of_the_Battle_of_al-Q%C4%81disiyyah_from_a_manuscript_of_the_Persian_epic_Sh%C4%81h-n%C4%81meh._Source-_British_Library_(MS._I.O.Islamic_3265_(1614)_f._602r).jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
